OL,3,GNEWSAGroup planned 'as much damage as
OL,4,Apossible' - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FPalestine Action supporters broke into
OL,7,Fa factory in Kent armed with
OL,8,Fsledgehammers, bolt cutters, smoke
OL,9,Fbombs and fireworks intent on causing
OL,10,Fas much damage as they could, a court
OL,11,Fhas heard.
OL,13,FA security guard was sprayed with red
OL,14,Fpaint and another's Land Rover was
OL,15,Fsmashed up with him inside it during
OL,16,Fthe dawn raid on Instro Precision in
OL,17,FSandwich on 17 June 2024, the Old
OL,18,FBailey was told.
OL,20,FNine men and women are on trial accused
OL,21,Fof criminal damage, burglary with
OL,22,Fintent and violent disorder.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
